- R1: finalization readers rU_finInput … rL_finInput and the new reader finA beside finInput;
  NMCCA2.finU/finZ/finW/finA/finL and NMSim.finSt deleted and re-pointed
- R2: NMSim.rdU … rdLog, fields_input, polyTimeComputable_rd deleted; uses re-pointed to
  InteractiveHandler.rU … rL and their lemmas
- R3: InteractiveHandler.rAns with rAns_eq; NMSim.rdAns and the private rFwd, rY deleted
- B1/B2: chunkAt folded onto coinBlock; coinBlock_flatten (from Lamport), map_coinBlock_flatten,
  coinBlock_flatten_append and ofFn_block_eq_coinBlock beside coinBlock; ofFn_nthCt,
  EnsembleLemmas.take_drop_ofFn_blocks, the ReductionMachine and GGM restatements derived from
  FunFamily.ofFn_blocks
- B3: the blocks aliases kept (escalated)
- L1: flatMap_range_drop, ofFn_natAdd_eq_drop, decide_map_ofFn, length_flatten_map_const,
  length_flatten_map_range, ofFn_eq_map_range in Foundations/BitLists (ZK copies deleted)
- L2: Games.padFin_append_split; L3: EnsembleLemmas.seedEquiv(Poly); L4: NMSim copy deleted
